# Configuration for the Strata serving API (/etc/init.d/strata-control
# and strata-control.service, from app-ai/strata-bin). This is the
# product service: the Terminal's foreground server -- OpenAI-
# compatible /v1 plus the Anthropic-compatible endpoint; the
# strata-control subcommands status, monitor, logs and connect talk to
# it. It starts the engine of the run config as its resident
# `strata --serve` child (that worker can also run standalone through
# strata.service of app-ai/strata; the run config names its engine by
# absolute path, docs/SOURCE_INSTALL.md).

# STRATA_PROFILE: REQUIRED, the run config to serve: the JSON of one
# prepared model ("exe", "tokenizer" and "args"; a path-like value is
# used as-is, strata_control/profiles.py resolve()). Create it with
# `strata-control launch` -- the guided flow, or non-interactive:
#   strata-control launch --family qwen --model q2_0 --yes --no-tui
# (docs/TERMINAL_LAUNCH.md). That flow is where models get downloaded
# and prepared; the SERVICE never downloads ("starting and serving
# never do this", `strata-control install --help`), so the unit refuses
# to start until STRATA_PROFILE names an existing file. `strata-control
# models list` shows the run configs that setup wrote.
STRATA_PROFILE=""

# Where the server listens. The serve defaults are 127.0.0.1:8095
# (strata_cli/cli.py); `strata-control launch` writes its own address
# into the run config it serves (the documented default endpoint is
# http://127.0.0.1:8080). Beyond localhost keep a real API key
# (docs/DOCKER.md, "The API key").
STRATA_HOST="127.0.0.1"
STRATA_PORT="8095"

# The key clients must send as Authorization: Bearer. The server reads
# STRATA_API_KEY from the environment (this file) or api_key from the
# run config; GET /health answers without a key. Uncomment to set:
#STRATA_API_KEY=""

# Extra `strata serve` flags (see `strata-control serve --help`):
# --offline disables remote image fetches and MCP/tool subprocesses,
# --parallel N requests answered at once, --max-queue N. Paths with
# spaces are not supported by the shipped units.
#STRATA_SERVE_ARGS="--offline"
